WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.740 --> 00:00:03.980
If you want a life of purpose,

00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:06.960
Begin by inverting the notion

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:09.320
that everything happens for a reason.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:14.900
All your efforts,

00:00:15.260 --> 00:00:16.480
personal,

00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:18.180
professional,

00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:22.060
carnal...

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:26.920
You must be willing to make the hard choices,

00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:29.400
do the unpleasant things,

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:32.180
risk your most valuable assets.

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:41.240
Because nothing worthwhile 
is ever achieved without sacrifice.

00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:50.360
Now that you're on the brink of greatness

00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:57.920
are there still limitations to 
what you'd be willing to sacrifice?

00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:01.380
In this case, a night alone with your husband.

00:01:01.660 --> 00:01:06.000
Would that be an acceptable condition 
of a firm offer to finance your company?

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:11.840
What do you really know about Anne Montgomery?

00:01:13.080 --> 00:01:15.880
Things could get dangerous very quickly.

00:01:16.280 --> 00:01:18.580
Things have always been dangerous.

00:01:19.700 --> 00:01:20.800
Sean!

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:24.740
What is it that you imagine I did him?

00:01:24.740 --> 00:01:26.480
I made a mistake.

00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:29.420
But I do not deserve to lose everything.

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:34.280
Regret is all I've felt since the moment we met.

00:01:34.660 --> 00:01:37.600
How many more people need to be hurt 
before you get what you want?

00:01:38.140 --> 00:01:40.340
You're more committed than you realize.

00:01:42.920 --> 00:01:44.640
The worst kind of victim

00:01:45.400 --> 00:01:47.960
is the one that chooses to create another.

00:01:47.960 --> 00:01:50.460
I am no one's victim.

00:01:53.240 --> 00:01:56.500
Are you absolutely certain 
this is the choice you want to make?

00:01:56.860 --> 00:01:58.320
I'm not what you think I am.

00:01:58.320 --> 00:02:01.140
Maybe not, but I'm beginning to see potential.

00:02:04.180 --> 00:02:08.060
True success comes at any cost.

